### The write, after briefly miscounting my dots

```bash
cat > /tmp/write_key.py << 'EOF'
import socket

pubkey = b"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIAe8Fp0f4BQLx0DpawVO76s/xM5LWvOGFJ8UvBXpg0yA lp@paperwork\n"

